 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "In fifteen ninety-three,",
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 1.493
  },
  {
   "text": "a Korean craftsman spends all night drilling holes into a block of wood.",
   "s": 1.646,
   "e": 5.556
  },
  {
   "text": "His friends think he's lost it.",
   "s": 6.034,
   "e": 7.397
  },
  {
   "text": "Holes?",
   "s": 7.724,
   "e": 8.308
  },
  {
   "text": "We need swords!",
   "s": 8.558,
   "e": 9.561
  },
  {
   "text": "Thirty thousand soldiers are marching on their tiny hilltop fort,",
   "s": 10.151,
   "e": 13.568
  },
  {
   "text": "and there are barely three thousand defenders.",
   "s": 13.846,
   "e": 15.956
  },
  {
   "text": "But he keeps drilling.",
   "s": 16.437,
   "e": 17.543
  },
  {
   "text": "One hundred holes,",
   "s": 18.108,
   "e": 19.302
  },
  {
   "text": "on top of a little cart.",
   "s": 19.539,
   "e": 20.607
  },
  {
   "text": "Into each hole, he slides an arrow,",
   "s": 21.178,
   "e": 23.029
  },
  {
   "text": "with a tiny tube of gunpowder tied to its side.",
   "s": 23.221,
   "e": 25.717
  },
  {
   "text": "Then he twists every fuse together,",
   "s": 26.197,
   "e": 28.368
  },
  {
   "text": "into one single string.",
   "s": 28.529,
   "e": 29.928
  },
  {
   "text": "The next morning,",
   "s": 30.594,
   "e": 31.29
  },
  {
   "text": "the enemy climbs the hill.",
   "s": 31.533,
   "e": 32.806
  },
  {
   "text": "Closer.",
   "s": 33.383,
   "e": 33.815
  },
  {
   "text": "And closer.",
   "s": 34.391,
   "e": 35.031
  },
  {
   "text": "Shoulder to shoulder.",
   "s": 35.554,
   "e": 36.647
  },
  {
   "text": "He lights one fuse.",
   "s": 37.368,
   "e": 38.631
  },
  {
   "text": "The spark races down the string,",
   "s": 39.093,
   "e": 40.844
  },
  {
   "text": "splits into a hundred sparks,",
   "s": 41.018,
   "e": 42.611
  },
  {
   "text": "and every arrow takes off at once.",
   "s": 42.785,
   "e": 44.693
  },
  {
   "text": "You see,",
   "s": 45.216,
   "e": 45.554
  },
  {
   "text": "each arrow is a tiny rocket.",
   "s": 45.82,
   "e": 47.609
  },
  {
   "text": "One man,",
   "s": 48.037,
   "e": 48.692
  },
  {
   "text": "one spark,",
   "s": 48.877,
   "e": 49.66
  },
  {
   "text": "one hundred shots.",
   "s": 49.854,
   "e": 51.133
  },
  {
   "text": "The Koreans called it the hwacha.",
   "s": 51.657,
   "e": 53.347
  },
  {
   "text": "The fire cart.",
   "s": 53.812,
   "e": 54.626
  },
  {
   "text": "And this fort had forty of them.",
   "s": 55.067,
   "e": 56.752
  },
  {
   "text": "And here's the crazy part.",
   "s": 57.322,
   "e": 58.45
  },
  {
   "text": "The army of thirty thousand turned around,",
   "s": 58.861,
   "e": 61.272
  },
  {
   "text": "and the little fort was never taken.",
   "s": 61.449,
   "e": 63.283
  }
 ]
